<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cotizar un envío - LogiTrack</title>
    <script>(function(){var t=localStorage.getItem('theme')||'light';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);})();</script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/portal.css?v=<%= assetVersion %>">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/shipments.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/incidents.css">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
    <style>
        .ctz-grid { display: grid; gap: .9rem; }
        .ctz-presets { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: .6rem; }
        .ctz-preset { display: block; position: relative; cursor: pointer; }
        .ctz-preset input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
        .ctz-preset-box {
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-start;
            gap: .15rem; height: 100%; min-height: 130px; box-sizing: border-box;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--c-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: .9rem .65rem;
            text-align: center; color: var(--c-text); background: var(--c-surface);
            transition: border-color .15s, background .15s, box-shadow .15s;
        }
        .ctz-preset:hover .ctz-preset-box { border-color: var(--c-text-2); }
        .ctz-preset input:checked + .ctz-preset-box {
            border-color: var(--c-primary); background: var(--c-primary-lt);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--c-primary) inset;
        }
        .ctz-preset-box .material-symbols-outlined { font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--c-primary); }
        .ctz-preset-name { font-weight: 600; }
        .ctz-preset-hint { font-size: .74rem; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--c-text-2); }
        .ctz-result { margin-top: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--c-border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.1rem; background: var(--c-surface); }
        .ctz-total { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: .5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .ctz-total-label { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--c-text-2); }
        .ctz-total-value { font-size: 1.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text); }
        .ctz-breakdown { margin-top: .75rem; font-size: .9rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--c-border); padding-top: .6rem; }
        .ctz-breakdown-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: .15rem 0; color: var(--c-text-2); }
        .ctz-toggle-adv { background: none; border: none; color: var(--c-primary); cursor: pointer; font: inherit; padding: 0; text-decoration: underline; }
        .ctz-disclaimer { display: flex; gap: .5rem; align-items: flex-start; font-size: .82rem; color: var(--c-text-2); margin-top: .9rem; }
        .ctz-disclaimer .material-symbols-outlined { font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .ctz-placeholder { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; color: var(--c-text-2); font-size: .9rem; }
        .ctz-spin { animation: ctz-rot 1s linear infinite; }
        @keyframes ctz-rot { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
        @media (max-width: 520px) { .ctz-presets { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .ctz-preset-box { min-height: 0; flex-direction: row; gap: .6rem; text-align: left; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="portal-nav">
        <a href="/" class="portal-brand">
            <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="LogiTrack" class="portal-logo">
            <span>LogiTrack</span>
        </a>
        <div class="portal-nav-right">
            <button id="btn-theme" class="portal-theme-btn" aria-label="Cambiar tema">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined" id="theme-icon">light_mode</span>
                <span id="theme-label">Modo claro</span>
            </button>
            <a href="/" class="portal-nav-login">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_back</span>
                Volver al portal
            </a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="portal-incident-section">
        <div class="portal-incident-layout portal-incident-layout--single">
            <div class="portal-incident-wrapper">
                <div class="portal-incident-card-head">
                    <span class="portal-incident-eyebrow">Cotizador</span>
                    <h1>Calculá el costo de tu envío</h1>
                    <p>Ingresá el destino y el tamaño del paquete para ver un valor estimado al instante.</p>
                </div>

                <form id="ctz-form" class="portal-incident-form" autocomplete="off">
                    <section class="portal-incident-block">
                        <div class="portal-incident-block-header">
                            <div class="portal-incident-block-icon">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">location_on</span>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3>Destino</h3>
                                <p>Elegí la provincia de destino. Si tenés el código postal, la estimación es más precisa.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="portal-incident-fields portal-incident-fields--two">
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="provinceId">Provincia de destino</label>
                                <select id="provinceId" name="provinceId">
                                    <option value="">Seleccioná una provincia...</option>
                                    <% provinces.forEach(function (p) { %>
                                        <option value="<%= p.id %>"><%= p.description %></option>
                                    <% }) %>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="postalCode">Código postal (opcional)</label>
                                <input type="text" id="postalCode" name="postalCode" maxlength="10" placeholder="Ej: 1407">
                                <small>Si lo cargás, tiene prioridad sobre la provincia.</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section class="portal-incident-block">
                        <div class="portal-incident-block-header">
                            <div class="portal-incident-block-icon">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">package_2</span>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3>Tamaño del paquete</h3>
                                <p>Elegí una opción aproximada. Si conocés el peso y volumen exactos, usá la carga manual.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ctz-grid">
                            <div class="ctz-presets">
                                <label class="ctz-preset">
                                    <input type="radio" name="size" value="chico" checked>
                                    <span class="ctz-preset-box">
                                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">deployed_code</span>
                                        <span class="ctz-preset-name">Chico</span>
                                        <span class="ctz-preset-hint">Hasta ~1 kg (sobre, caja chica)</span>
                                    </span>
                                </label>
                                <label class="ctz-preset">
                                    <input type="radio" name="size" value="mediano">
                                    <span class="ctz-preset-box">
                                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">inventory_2</span>
                                        <span class="ctz-preset-name">Mediano</span>
                                        <span class="ctz-preset-hint">Hasta ~5 kg (caja mediana)</span>
                                    </span>
                                </label>
                                <label class="ctz-preset">
                                    <input type="radio" name="size" value="grande">
                                    <span class="ctz-preset-box">
                                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">box</span>
                                        <span class="ctz-preset-name">Grande</span>
                                        <span class="ctz-preset-hint">Hasta ~15 kg (bulto grande)</span>
                                    </span>
                                </label>
                            </div>

                            <div>
                                <button type="button" id="ctz-toggle-adv" class="ctz-toggle-adv">Cargar peso y volumen manualmente</button>
                            </div>

                            <div id="ctz-advanced" class="portal-incident-fields portal-incident-fields--two" style="display:none;">
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label for="weightKg">Peso (kg)</label>
                                    <input type="number" id="weightKg" name="weightKg" min="0" step="0.1" placeholder="Ej: 3">
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label for="volumeM3">Volumen (m³)</label>
                                    <input type="number" id="volumeM3" name="volumeM3" min="0" step="0.001" placeholder="Ej: 0.02">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section class="portal-incident-block">
                        <div class="portal-incident-block-header">
                            <div class="portal-incident-block-icon">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">shield</span>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3>Valor declarado (opcional)</h3>
                                <p>Si lo completás, sumamos el seguro de mercadería a la estimación.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="portal-incident-fields">
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="declaredValue">Valor declarado ($)</label>
                                <input type="number" id="declaredValue" name="declaredValue" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="Ej: 25000">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <div class="form-actions">
                        <div class="portal-incident-actions-buttons">
                            <a href="/" class="btn-secondary">Volver</a>
                            <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">calculate</span>
                                Calcular costo
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </form>

                <div id="ctz-result" class="ctz-result" aria-live="polite">
                    <span class="ctz-placeholder">Completá el destino y el tamaño para ver el costo estimado.</span>
                </div>

                <p class="ctz-disclaimer">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">info</span>
                    Valor estimado y orientativo. El costo final puede variar y se confirma al generar el envío.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <script src="/js/theme.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/js/portal-cotizador.js?v=<%= assetVersion %>" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
